flowchart TD
    Settings[Appearance and Writing settings] --> Store[Local studio.json]
    Store --> Motion[Orbit / Helix / Wave / Chrome S]
    Motion --> Guards[Pause / Reduce Motion / hidden-window guard]
    Store --> Edge[Free / left / right screen placement]
    Keys[Hold / tap / double-tap] --> Coordinator[Transcription coordinator]
    Dock[Floating Record button] --> Coordinator
    Coordinator --> ASR[Local speech recognition]
    ASR --> Actions[Exact opt-in action cue]
    Actions -->|No action| Snippet[Exact saved snippet]
    Snippet -->|No snippet| AI[Optional configured cleanup provider]
    AI -->|Success or visible failure fallback| Format[Local style and spelling corrections]
    Format --> Paste[Paste into destination / local history]
    Snippet -->|Matched| Paste
    Coordinator --> Events[Real recording / mic / streaming events]
    Events --> Home[Home and floating companion]
    Paste --> Recent[Home recent history]
